    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "With a wet hand, pull an edge of the dough up and fold it into the middle; turn the bowl and repeat all the way around. Cover. Repeat every 15 min, 4 rounds in all. Then let rise until doubled, ≈1 h more."
    },
    {
      "kind": "stage",
