    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Grease both pans. Divide the dough into 18 pieces of ≈75 g. Cup your palm over each piece and roll it in circles on the counter into a tight, smooth ball."
    },
    {
      "kind": "step",
      "ings": [],
      "body": "Set 12 balls in the 13×9 pan (3 rows of 4) and 6 in the round pan (1 in the center, 5 around). Cover with a damp towel and let rise until puffy, nearly doubled and touching, <span class=\"rc-nw\">1–2 h</span>. Heat the oven to <span class=\"rc-nw\">350 °F <span class=\"rc-muted\">(177 °C)</span></span> for the last 30 min."
